# ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
# OpenBridge environment configuration
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in ONLY what you want to use.
# The app is fully functional with an EMPTY file: the deterministic
# offline tutor handles all explanations with zero API keys.
# ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————

# ——— AI tutor (optional) ————————————————————————————————————————
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint works:
#   OpenAI:      https://api.openai.com/v1        (models: gpt-4o-mini, …)
#   Groq:        https://api.groq.com/openai/v1   (models: llama-3.1-8b-instant, …)
#   Together:    https://api.together.xyz/v1
#   OpenRouter:  https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   Ollama:      http://localhost:11434/v1        (models: llama3.2, …)
# The API key enables the provider. The URL and model below are defaults.
# OPENBRIDGE_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENBRIDGE_LLM_API_KEY=
# OPENBRIDGE_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# Optional tuning (sensible defaults shown):
# OPENBRIDGE_LLM_TIMEOUT_MS=12000
# OPENBRIDGE_LLM_MAX_TOKENS=320

# ——— Supabase (optional) ————————————————————————————————————————
# Reserved for future classroom integration. The MVP stores progress locally.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
# Privacy note: OpenBridge stores student progress in the browser's
# localStorage only. Keep any configured AI provider key on the server.
# ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
